        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-14T07:25:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wraith and Haka have similar effects they can make where the next damage they take is reduced by 2 (or more).</p>\n<p>So,  example 1,  Wraith uses stealth to reduce the next damage by 2.   She takes no damage that round, she uses stealth again, now reducing the next damage by 4.   She takes 3 damage.    Does she have 1 damage “left” or is it all used up?    Similar question with Haka of Shielding.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:37.409Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
