        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-14T12:44:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would all be used up, since the would of been the next damage dealt to her after using the ability. If she even only took one damage it would result in the zero damage, and the other three points would be gone. Same would apply to Haka.</p>",
