        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/e95f7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-22T06:18:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would leave well enough alone. Either it works the same as Haka and prevents more than 2 damage or it doesn’t and will probably be ruled that all instance of the use of the power are used up on the first 2 damage. Because they all would prevent the same next 2 damage.</p>\n<p>Hedge</p>",
