        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-22T13:47:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We agree!  Consistency IS golden, and it’s something we put a TON of work on.  However, we missed a few spots, and sadly, this is one of them.  We have a list of a few things that will be minorly reworded come the 2nd Edition of the game (whenever that happens), just for clarity.</p>",
